              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maz’ Uhoraho abaza Samweli, at’ Uzogeza hehe kuririra Sauli, kandi namaze kwanka kw aba umwami w’Abisirayeli? Uzuza ihembe ryawe amavuta, uheze uze ngutume kuri Isayi w’i Betelehemu, kuko nironkeye umwami mu bahungu biwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Samweli arasiguza, ati Nogenda nte? Erega Sauli ni yavyumva azonyica. Uhoraho aramwishura, ati Hitana inka y’ishashi, ugende, uvuge, uti Nje gushikanira Uhoraho ikimazi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.9.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 9:16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uheze uhamagare Isayi aze kur’ ico kimazi; nanje nzokwereka uk’ uzogenza; uz’ undobanurize amavuta uwo nzokurangira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.16.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.2.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Abam 2:13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko Samweli agenza nk’uk’ Uhoraho yamubgiye, aja i Betelehemu. Ashitseyo, abakuru b’igisagara baza kumusanganira, bahinda agashitsi. Baramubaza, bati Mbeg’ ugenzwa n’amahoro? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.16.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
