            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arik’ Uhoraho abarira Samweli, ati Nta co urāba ishusho yiwe, cank’ ikirēho ciwe, kuko ntāmushimye; erega jewe sindāba nk’ukw abantu barāba: kukw abantu barāba ku rukoba gusa, ariko jewe Uhoraho ndāba mu mutima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.16.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 16:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze Isayi ahamagara Abinadabu, amwereka Samweli. Samweli aravuga, ati N’uyu nyene Uhoraho si we yatoranije. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.16.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 16:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isayi arongera amwereka Shama; na ho nyene Samweli aravuga, at’ Eka n’uyu na we Uhoraho si we yatoranije. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.16.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 16:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko Isayi yerekana indwi mu bahungu biwe ngo Samweli abarābe. Samweli abarira Isayi, at’ Aba si bo Uhoraho yatoranije. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.16.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 16:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
