        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko Samweli aca yābīra rya hembe ry’amavuta, ayamusukako bakuru be bamukikije. Kuva uwo musi Mpwemu w’Uhoraho yama aza kuri Dawidi akābushūngwe. Nuko Samweli arahaguruka, asubira i Rama.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
